---
import CompliantLayout from '@/layouts/CompliantLayout.astro';
---

<CompliantLayout title="Disclosure">
  <article class="container-prose py-16 prose prose-lg prose-ink">
    <h1>Disclosure</h1>
    <p>
      We don&rsquo;t use affiliate links. We don&rsquo;t earn a commission when you click a
      link on this site or buy something we mention.
    </p>
    <p>
      Some links go to shops run by the same team behind RefillWatch. Those are labeled
      (for example &ldquo;From the team behind RefillWatch&rdquo; or &ldquo;From our shop&rdquo;),
      so you always know where a link goes.
    </p>
    <p>
      We never accept payment to recommend a product.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you have questions about any specific recommendation, please
      reach out: <a href="mailto:hello@refillwatch.org">hello@refillwatch.org</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</CompliantLayout>
